<h2 style="color: #f39c12;">✨ New Feature Announcement</h2>

<p>Hi {{customerName}},</p>

<p>We're excited to announce a new feature that will make your experience even better!</p>

<div class="info-box">
  <strong>{{title}}</strong>
  <p style="margin: 8px 0 0 0;">{{description}}</p>
</div>

<h3 style="margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #2c3e50;">What's New</h3>

<ul style="margin-left: 20px;">
  {{#each features}}
  <li>{{this}}</li>
  {{/each}}
</ul>

<h3 style="margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #2c3e50;">How to Use</h3>

<p>
  This feature is now available to all {{restaurantName}} users. You can start using it immediately by logging into your account.
</p>

<p style="text-align: center;">
  <a href="{{{learnMoreLink}}}" class="button">Learn More & Get Started</a>
</p>

<h3 style="margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #2c3e50;">Why We Built This</h3>

<p>
  We listened to your feedback and built this feature to help you manage your restaurant more efficiently. This is part of our commitment to continuously improve the BlackPot platform.
</p>

<h3 style="margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #2c3e50;">Have Questions?</h3>

<p>
  Check out our comprehensive <a href="{{{helpCenter}}}">help documentation</a> or <a href="mailto:support@blackpot.com">contact our support team</a>.
</p>

<div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d4edda 0%, #c3e6cb 100%); border-left: 4px solid #28a745; padding: 16px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 4px;">
  <p style="margin: 0; color: #155724;">
    More features are coming soon! Follow our <a href="{{{releaseNotesLink}}}">release notes</a> to stay updated.
  </p>
</div>

<p style="color: #7f8c8d; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 20px;">
  Announcement for {{restaurantName}} | {{announcementDate}}
</p>